{
  "9726": {
    "en": [
      "What wrong have I done you,",
      "why did you strike me with an arrow?",
      "With one arrow you have slain",
      "the lives of two unfortunates!",
      "I am a child who roams the forest;",
      "I know nothing at all —",
      "I gather fruits and roots,",
      "and sing the hymns of the Sama Veda!",
      "My father, blind from birth,",
      "tormented by thirst,",
      "waits watching the path —",
      "for when I shall go to him with water.",
      "After my death, carry me there;",
      "lay this body in his lap —",
      "see, see that you do not forget:",
      "give him the gift of water!",
      "My father will forgive you,",
      "for his is a heart of mercy!"
    ],
