  "9728": {
    "en": [
      "Tell me, tell me, Father, where has he gone?",
      "Where is that brother of mine, in what wood?",
      "Why do I not see him?",
      "He said he would play this morning,",
      "then why has he not come even now?",
      "I wander from wood to wood calling 'Brother, Brother' —",
      "why, oh why, is there no answer?"
