  "9729": {
    "en": [
      "Who knows where he is!",
      "Counting, counting the hours in solitude,",
      "I sit here waiting for him!",
      "Alone here, at the hut door —",
      "my child, you have not come!",
      "Come quickly, come quickly, come!",
      "Never mind fetching the water —",
      "you yourself are the water of my thirst!",
      "Why does fear wake in my mind?",
      "Why is it that today,",
      "I feel I am losing you, losing you!",
      "Who knows!"
