  "9730": {
    "en": [
      "At last, I think, you have come!",
      "Come into my heart, my child!",
      "Where were you in the forest, on this dark night,",
      "in this storm, forgetting your blind father?",
      "All night long, alas, I have been",
      "watching the path; I am tormented by thirst —",
      "put water to my lips, come near me!"
