  "9731": {
    "en": [
      "Forgive, father, what was done in ignorance — I clasp your feet —",
      "how shall I tell it? I shudder in terror!",
      "In the dark I aimed a keen arrow,",
      "and mistaking him for an elephant slew your noble son;",
      "by fault of evil stars I have fallen into the mire of sin!"
