  "9732": {
    "en": [
      "What did you say, what have I heard — can such a thing ever be?",
      "Why, he went just now to the bank of the Sarayu to fetch water —",
      "who would have the power to slay him? He is a sage's son!",
      "He is a tender child, the darling of our love —",
      "is there anyone so cruel as to slay him?",
      "No, no, no — wherever he is, bring him to me;",
      "I have lain awake all night — I cannot bear delay!",
      "Still no answer — is there no fear in your soul?",
      "O wretch — what have you done —"
    ],
