  "9736": {
    "en": [
      "Go to the eternal abode, leaving delusion and illusion behind,",
      "where there is no sorrow, no darkness at all.",
      "In that world there is no age, no death, no grief;",
      "only a stream of joy flows on forever!",
      "Go to the eternal abode, the house of immortality;",
      "the immortals will receive you with open hearts!",
      "There god-sages, king-sages, Brahma-sages",
      "rapt in meditation sing in one strain!",
      "Go to the eternal abode, the dwelling of light,",
      "into that white, ever-stainless, holy radiance —",
      "where go the vowed givers, the truthful, the virtuous —",
      "go, child, go to that abode of gods!"
