  "9737": {
    "en": [
      "All is ended, like a dream;",
      "where has he hidden — where is he, alas!",
      "The flower garden has grown pale;",
      "why do the birds sing their songs no more?",
      "Oh! all I see is emptiness —",
      "where is he, alas!",
      "For whom shall the flowers bloom any more?",
      "The madhabi and malati weep distraught;",
      "he who used to come to draw water,",
      "he who used to come to pluck fruit —",
      "Oh! he will come no more —",
      "where is he, alas!"
